,p_translate_to_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<section class="news_detail">',
'    <div class="container">',
'        <div class="row">',
'            <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-7">',
'                <div class="news_detail_left">',
'                    <div class="news_detail_image_box">',
'                        <img src="#APP_IMAGES#Noticia-9.png" alt="">',
'                        <div class="news_detail_date_box">',
'                            <p>20 Jan 2022</p>',
'                        </div>',
'                    </div>',
'                    <br>',
'                    <div class="news_detail_content">',
'                        <h2>A day to donate</h2>',
'                        <p class="news_detail_one_text">',
unistr('                        On January 20, at <b>Grupo Kasto Divisi\00F3n Molinos</b>, we were fortunate enough to collaborate with <a href="https://blooders.org/" target="_BLANK"><b>Blooders.org</b></a> in an altruistic campaign and with the truly authentic')
||' intention to help the many people who need blood or any of its derivatives.',
'                        </p>',
'                        <p class="news_detail_two_text">',
'                            The event took place at the facilities of Grupo Kasto Molinos Planta Central, in Zapopan, Jalisco. ',
'                        </p>',
'                        <p class="news_detail_three_text">',
'                            The enthusiasm of the donors was the main characteristic on the day, where the desire to help far exceeded the nervousness for the needles. ',
'                        </p>',
'                        <p class="news_detail_three_text">',
